<title>FINLAND: Trade in Raisio to resume -bourse.</title>
<headline>Trade in Raisio to resume -bourse.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Raisio group shares will resume at 1540/1240 GMT, the Helsinki bourse said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The stock was suspended pending news of a U.S. partner for its Benecol cholesterol-cutting margarine. Raision was unchanged at 270 markka before the suspension.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +3589 6805 0247, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
